'''Reroot Rampage''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Nokko}}'s {{A|Reroot}} that spawns a [[Sprodling]] every time Nokko picks up Reroot's Fungal Spores. These Sprodlings will seek out enemies and bounce on their heads, dealing increasing {{D|Toxin}} damage with every bounce.
