==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''Exalted''' under {{Faction|Red Veil}}, or the rank of '''Partner''' under {{Faction|The Perrin Sequence}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
* Picking up Fungal Spores during Reroot will spawn a Sprodling, up to a maximum of '''10''' Sprodlings. Sprodlings follow Nokko, even after Reroot ends.
** Unlatched Sprodlings following Nokko have infinite duration.
* Sprodling will latch onto an enemy and bounce on them, {{D|Stun|Stunning}} them and dealing {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''250''' {{D|Toxin}} Damage in an {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''8''' meter radius per bounce.
** Each bounce has its damage multiplied by {{MathText|(Bounce Number){{Exp|1.2}}}}.
** Each bounce increases the [[Critical Hit|Critical Chance]] of the next bounce by a flat '''20%'''. Sprodlings have an innate '''2x''' Critical Damage multiplier.
** AoE has damage falloff.
** Sprodling can bounce a maximum of '''20''' times (~'''15''' seconds) before despawning. The Sprodling will also despawn if their target dies.
*Sprodlings can activate {{Arcane|Arcane Camisado}} and {{M|Archon Continuity}}.
**{{Arcane|Arcane Camisado}} will only gain stacks while in {{A|Reroot}}
*Sprodings do not benefit from {{M|Summoner's Wrath}}, {{M|Tenacious Bond}}, {{A|Nourish}}, [[Emerald Archon Shard]] Toxin Damage, or {{Arcane|Arcane Crepuscular}}.

== Bugs ==
* The ability hover description lists an "Explosion Damage" stat that is not present on the ability. Sprodlings only use the values listed under "Damage" in the hover description.

